      "text": "@NaveenDavis11 @SemiAnalysis_ TileRT is an open-source tile-based runtime (tile-ai/TileRT) for ultra-low-latency LLM decode. It compiles models into persistent megakernels that overlap compute, memory, and communication at tile granularity, prioritizing single-user speed (hundreds to 1000+ tok/s) over batch",
      "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2120973131598676240"
