      "text": "@SemiAnalysis_ MegaKernels fuse launch-bound decode kernels into one persistent scheduler — hence 2x in low-occupancy decode, not compute-bound prefill. Biggest single-user, it narrows as concurrency saturates HBM; TP24 already uses 1/3 of the rack. Views are my own, not investment advice.",
      "url": "https://x.com/XiaoVic74463/status/2120943791322386831"
    },
